00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.290
in Urban Studies and Planning in 2014.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:01.230
And we're very excited to
have you at this joint program

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.510
of the Yale Program for
the Study of Antisemitism,

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:06.180
and the American and
Comparative Political Behavior

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.470
workshop.

